{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the main defects: review creation currently maps duplicate/invalid cases to 500/503, the update path increments aggregates instead of recomputing them, deletion never recomputes them, and the public DTO embeds the full customer object. I’m tightening the request model and replacing aggregate updates with a recalculation from the reviews that actually exist."}}
